# The Horde Warrior armor chain: Speak with Ruga, Trial at the Field of Giants
# and Speak with Thun'grim (1823-1825, level 20), then Brutal Armor (1838),
# Brutal Hauberk (1848) and three pieces from three crafters: Ula'elek in
# Sen'jin Village (1839, 1842, 1843), Orm Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff (1840,
# 1844, 1845) and Velora Nitely in the Undercity (1841, 1846, 1847), level 30.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# objectives, drops and places; Forever's Warrior class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for the rewards and
# Forever's changes (none for this chain); the Razorfen Kraul entrance from
# data/forever/dungeons.json (The Barrens 42.9,90.2, live frame). Roogug, who
# drops the Vial of Phlogiston, has no spawn in the data: he is a quilboar
# elite inside Razorfen Kraul (
# https://wowwiki-archive.fandom.com/wiki/Vial_of_Phlogiston). Iron Bars have
# no source in the data: they are smelted (Mining) or bought; the guide points
# at the Orgrimmar auction house (Auctioneer Thathung, npc 8673).
# horde/04-the-barrens does 1823-1825 on the route; they are repeated here for
# anyone off it. Brutal Armor needs a dungeon (Razorfen Kraul), and the pieces
# send you to Ashenvale, Stonetalon, the Wetlands and three capitals: a guide
# of its own, not a leveling step.
# Brutal Armor and its follow-ups (level 30) are above the beta's level cap:
# this part is written from the data, not from play.

step Speak with Ruga (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll,Skyborne
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 20, Sorek in the Valley of Honor sends you to Ruga Ragetotem in Camp Taurajo.
  level 20
  accept 1823 npc 3354                        -- Sorek

step Speak with Ruga (Thunder Bluff)
  only Tauren
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 20, Torm Ragetotem, the warrior trainer of Thunder Bluff, sends you to Ruga Ragetotem in Camp Taurajo.
  level 20
  accept 1823 npc 3041                        -- Torm Ragetotem

step Speak with Ruga (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 20, Baltus Fowler, a warrior trainer of the Undercity, sends you to Ruga Ragetotem in Camp Taurajo.
  level 20
  accept 1823 npc 4595                        -- Baltus Fowler

step Trial at the Field of Giants
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly to Camp Taurajo. South of the camp the Silithid Mounds dot the Field of Giants: the silithid there carry the Twitching Antennae.
  turnin 1823                                 -- Ruga Ragetotem
  accept 1824
  collect 7119 quest 1824.1                   -- Twitching Antennae from the silithid
  turnin 1824 reward 7120                     -- Ruga Ragetotem
  accept 1825

step Thun'grim Firegaze
  tip Thun'grim camps beside the road east of the Crossroads. Brutal Armor is a level 30 quest; you can take it now and gather for it on the way.
  turnin 1825
  accept 1838

step Roogug in Razorfen Kraul
  tip Roogug is an elite quilboar inside Razorfen Kraul, the dungeon at the south end of the Barrens; he drops the Vial of Phlogiston. Razorfen Kraul is a dungeon: grouping up is advised.
  collect 6841 quest 1838.4 @42.9,90.2 live   -- Vial of Phlogiston, from Roogug

step Windshear Mine
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip The Windshear Mine lies at the east end of Windshear Crag in Stonetalon. Its kobolds drop the Smoky Iron Ingots.
  collect 7126 quest 1838.1                   -- Smoky Iron Ingots from the Windshear kobolds

step Hillsbrad Miners
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The Hillsbrad Miners work the mine in the west of Hillsbrad Foothills; they drop the Powdered Azurite. Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades and head south through Silverpine Forest.
  collect 7127 quest 1838.2                   -- Powdered Azurite from the Hillsbrad Miners

step Iron Bars
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Miners smelt Iron Bars from Iron Ore (Mining 125); everyone else buys them at the auction house in Orgrimmar.
  collect 3575 quest 1838.3 @55.9,62.7        -- Iron Bars: Auctioneer Thathung

step Brutal Hauberk
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Thun'grim beside the road east of the Crossroads. Brutal Hauberk is the first piece; he then sends you to three crafters for the rest.
  turnin 1838                                 -- Thun'grim Firegaze
  accept 1848
  turnin 1848 reward 7133
  accept 1839
  accept 1840
  accept 1841

step Ula'elek
  zone Durotar
  tip Ula'elek is in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast.
  turnin 1839                                 -- Ula'elek
  accept 1842

step Satyr Hooves
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The Xavian satyrs camp in eastern Ashenvale, with the Felmusk satyrs further west; both drop Uncloven Satyr Hooves.
  collect 7128 quest 1842.1                   -- Uncloven Satyr Hooves

step Brutal Gauntlets
  zone Durotar
  turnin 1842                                 -- Ula'elek, Sen'jin Village
  accept 1843
  turnin 1843 reward 7129

step Orm Stonehoof
  zone Thunder Bluff
  turnin 1840                                 -- Orm Stonehoof
  accept 1844

step Chimaeric Horn
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip The Chimaera Matriarch roams the south-west of Stonetalon near the Fledgling and Young Chimaeras; she drops the Galvanized Horn.
  collect 6840 quest 1844.1                   -- Galvanized Horn from the Chimaera Matriarch

step Brutal Helm
  zone Thunder Bluff
  turnin 1844                                 -- Orm Stonehoof
  accept 1845
  turnin 1845 reward 7130

step Velora Nitely
  zone Undercity
  tip Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades; the Undercity lies below the Ruins of Lordaeron.
  turnin 1841                                 -- Velora Nitely
  accept 1846

step Dragonmaw Shinbones
  zone Wetlands
  tip The Dragonmaw orcs camp in the middle of the Wetlands, south of the road; Raiders, Swamprunners, Centurions, Shadowwarders and Bonewarders all drop the Sturdy Dragonmaw Shinbones.
  collect 7134 quest 1846.1                   -- Sturdy Dragonmaw Shinbones

step Brutal Legguards
  zone Undercity
  turnin 1846                                 -- Velora Nitely
  accept 1847
  turnin 1847 reward 7132
